  "instructions": [
    "Heat butter in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add garlic and onion and saute until the onion is translucent.",
    "Add confit tomatoes, pav bhaji masala, and salt, and stir well.",
    "Add peas and cook until they are thawed and heated through.",
    "Stir in cooked sushi rice and cook for 2-3 minutes.",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning as needed.",
    "Garnish with chopped cilantro and serve hot."
